<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Nov unemployment falls to 4.56 pct - IBGE.</title>
<headline>Brazil Nov unemployment falls to 4.56 pct - IBGE.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's unemployment rate in November was 4.56 percent, down from 5.14 percent in October, the National Statistics Institute (IBGE) said.</p>
</text>
